flowchart TD
    A[Login with username and password] --> V{Both given?}
    V -- no --> E400[400 VALIDATION_FAILED, count unchanged]
    V -- yes --> L{Username locked now?}
    L -- yes --> E429[429 RATE_LIMIT_LOGIN_LOCKED with retryAt]
    L -- no --> M{Member with this username, any case?}
    M -- yes --> MP{Password matches?}
    MP -- no --> F[Add one to the failed-attempt count]
    MP -- yes --> MS{Member active?}
    MS -- no --> E403D[403 AUTHORIZATION_ACCOUNT_DEACTIVATED, count unchanged]
    MS -- yes --> OK[Reset count, start session, 201 with token and member]
    M -- no --> P{Pending registration with this username?}
    P -- yes --> PP{Password matches?}
    PP -- yes --> E403P[403 AUTHORIZATION_REGISTRATION_PENDING, count unchanged]
    PP -- no --> F
    P -- no --> R{Rejected registration with this username and matching password?}
    R -- yes --> E403R[403 AUTHORIZATION_REGISTRATION_REJECTED, count unchanged]
    R -- no --> F
    F --> C{Count reached 5?}
    C -- yes --> LOCK[Lock username for 15 minutes] --> E429
    C -- no --> E401[401 AUTHENTICATION_FAILED: Username or password incorrect]
